TRACKS X 100 DO 3000 STEP 200 LAYER metal2 metal4 ;
VIAS 10 ;
   - VIA23_2cut_E
      + RECT metal2 ( -50 -90 ) ( 250 90 )
      + RECT via2 ( -50 -50 ) ( 50 50 )
      + RECT via2 ( 150 -50 ) ( 250 50 )
      + RECT metal3 ( -90 -50 ) ( 290 50 ) ;
   - VIA23_2cut_N
      + RECT metal2 ( -50 -90 ) ( 50 290 )
      + RECT via2 ( -50 -50 ) ( 50 50 )
      + RECT via2 ( -50 150 ) ( 50 250 )
      + RECT metal3 ( -90 -50 ) ( 90 250 ) ;
